# Copy to `.dev.vars` for `npm run dev`, or set the same name in the Cloudflare
# dashboard (Workers & Pages -> your Worker -> Settings -> Variables and Secrets)
# after deploying.
#
# Optional. Without it, lookups to api.theintrodb.org are anonymous, which is
# rate limited per IP -- and every Cloudflare Worker shares Cloudflare's egress
# addresses, so a deployed Worker is much safer with a key of its own.
# Get one at https://theintrodb.org/docs
# TIDB_API_KEY=
